# Tests covering TrayBridge (the named-pipe seam called by the tray UI).

## TrayApp menu items (exactly 4, as required):
  1. "状态: 运行中"        (display only, Enabled = false)
  2. "生成配对码"           → IPairingService.CreateCode(IPAddress.Loopback, "Tray")
                              → MessageBox shows the 6-digit code + countdown
  3. "开机自启"             (Checked = AutoStartManager.IsEnabledAsync())
                              → toggles via EnableAsync() / DisableAsync()
  4. "退出"                 → IHostApplicationLifetime.StopApplication()

## H.NotifyIcon decision:
  Switched to non-WPF H.NotifyIcon 2.2.0 (TrayIconWithContextMenu). Single-file
  publish validated:  dotnet publish -c Release -r win-x64 --self-contained
                       -p:PublishSingleFile=true   → exit 0.
  Target framework moved to net9.0-windows; UseWindowsForms=true added so the
  STA tray thread can host an Application.Run() message pump.

